{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KhrfLClQlZ1795707011.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>印尼一個非法金礦水浸，16人死亡，10人失蹤。</p><p></p><p>救援人員在事發後數天，繼續搜尋失蹤者。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.MINE-2300_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ELdP5RNSZh1795707029.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>現場是西爪哇省一個非法金礦，當局稱，周一晚大雨導致金礦附近河水氾濫，倒灌入礦井。由於涉及非法採礦，相關人員未在事發後第一時間報警。</p><p></p><p>當地礦工與居民最初嘗試自行抽走礦井中的積水，搜救部門直至周三凌晨，才接獲礦工被困的報告，並動員了三百多人展開救援。</p><p></p><p>搜救部門表示，高水位、曲折的通道、濕滑的地形，以及有限的照明，使救援工作變得困難。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:03:56.925682+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:35:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T16:57:33.585145+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T15:57:18.790866+00:00","content_hash":"84c29214c352e19c9ac68514809e56deecf392e68dcea451faea49fb5f9e7d87","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:03:56.925682+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}